course: dictionary
lesson: 7519
title: Powerful: many meanings, one word
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: One word can have several meanings, and the context tells you which one the writer means. «The tiger looks powerful and dangerous in the dark forest.» Here powerful means strong and frightening, because the tiger's glowing stripes make it look fierce.
explain: «Leopard seals are big hunters with powerful jaws and long teeth.» Powerful jaws are strong enough to catch penguins. «Jupiter has the most powerful auroras in the Solar System» means the strongest auroras. Swap in strong or strongest and check that the sentence still makes sense.
explain: Powerful can also describe a machine or a speech. A powerful engine can do a lot of work, and a powerful speech has a strong effect on the people who hear it. The clues around the word show you which meaning fits.
fact: «Powerful» means very strong, or having a strong force.
fact: «Powerful» can mean having great control or influence over people, as in «a powerful king».
fact: «Powerful» can mean having a strong effect, as in «a powerful medicine» or «a powerful speech».
fact: «Powerful» can describe a machine that can do a lot of work, such as «a powerful engine».
fact: Powerful changes form: powerful, more powerful, most powerful.
exercise: «Leopard seals have powerful jaws and long teeth.» What does powerful mean here? | Very slow | Very tiny | *Very strong | Very kind
exercise: «Jupiter has the most powerful auroras in the Solar System.» Which word means the same as powerful here? | Oldest | Gentlest | *Strongest | Smallest
exercise: Ella says a powerful engine is one that looks pretty. What does powerful mean for an engine? | Made of wood | Painted bright red | *Able to do a lot of work | Quiet and small
test: «The king was powerful, and everyone in the land obeyed him.» What does powerful mean? | Very cold | *Having great control over people | Often lost | Very tiny
test: «The tiger looks powerful in the dark forest.» What does the sentence suggest about the tiger? | It is very small | It is hungry and lost | *It looks strong and dangerous | It is sleepy
exam: «His powerful speech moved the whole room to tears.» What does powerful mean here? | Very cheap | Very short | Very quiet | *Having a strong effect
